Slayer vs Slayer
Engage in Slayer vs Slayer combat across various maps. Win 5 rounds to claim victory. Farm AI fodder demons and utilize map pickups for resources.
https://www.nexusmods.com/doometernal/mods/1041
https://www.moddb.com/mods/slayervsslayer
https://gamebanana.com/mods/428520

Co-operative Mode
Play various maps with friends. Slayers are fully loaded and should work together to complete combat encounters.
https://www.nexusmods.com/doometernal/mods/1062
https://www.moddb.com/mods/co-operative-mode
https://gamebanana.com/mods/428523

Invasion Mode
Play campaign maps with Demon Players hunting the Slayer. The Slayer must complete all combat encounters. The Demons must kill the Slayer.
https://www.nexusmods.com/doometernal/mods/1103
https://www.moddb.com/mods/invasion-mode
https://gamebanana.com/mods/428528

